{"seq":66,"slug":"model-context-protocol-mcp","title":"模型上下文协议 MCP","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp","rating":{"composite":4.18,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"模型上下文协议-mcp-总览\">模型上下文协议 MCP·总览</h1><p>2024 年底 Anthropic 把一个内部接口标准开源出来，取名 Model Context Protocol。它要解决的事情其实很朴素：让任意一个 AI 应用，用同一套语言，去对接任意一个外部能力——一个数据库、一份文档、一个 Jira、一台浏览器。在 MCP 出现之前，每接一个工具都要为每个模型客户端单独写一遍胶水代码；MCP 把这件事变成「一次实现、处处可用」的协议层。到 2026 年中，官方 Registry 已收录近万个服务器记录，独立普查则统计到一万七千余个公共 MCP 服务器，TypeScript/Python 两套 SDK 月下载量越过九千万——它已经从一个厂商提案长成了事实标准。</p>\n<p>本 hub 的主角是<strong>协议标准本身</strong>，而不是某个 agent 框架或某种应用模式。我们关心 MCP 在线路上长什么样、它定义了哪些原语、host/client/server 三者如何分工、消息怎么用 JSON-RPC 编码、传输与鉴权怎么落地。换句话说，本 hub 教你「读懂规范、自己实现一个合规的 server 或 client」，而不是「用某个库快速搭一个 demo」。</p>\n<p>四个章节构成一条由浅入深的主线，请按顺序读：</p>\n<p>第一条线是<strong>基础</strong>。先讲清为何需要 MCP——它本质是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个模型客户端 × <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个工具的笛卡尔积接线问题，降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M+N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的线性问题；再讲 host/client/server 的三层角色划分；最后落到协议地基 JSON-RPC 2.0 与能力协商。读完这一章，你能在脑中画出一条完整的 MCP 连接。</p>\n<p>第二条线是<strong>原语</strong>。MCP 只定义了少数几种「积木」：服务器侧的工具、资源、提示，客户端侧的采样、引出、根。三篇文档分别吃透这三组，搞清楚「谁控制谁」——工具由模型驱动、资源由应用驱动、提示由用户驱动，这条控制权轴线是理解整个协议的钥匙。</p>\n<p>第三条线是<strong>构建</strong>。从用官方 SDK 写一个真实 server 起步，讲到传输层（stdio 与 Streamable HTTP）和连接生命周期（每请求自证版本与能力、优雅关闭），再专门用一篇讲安全——2026 年初接连爆出的 tool poisoning、跨租户泄漏与三十余个 CVE，让 OAuth 2.1、资源指示器、令牌绑定从可选项变成了必修课。</p>\n<p>第四条线是<strong>实践</strong>。先看生态全景：有哪些主流客户端、Registry 怎么用、采用数据如何；再把 MCP 和它最像的两个东西——原生函数调用、ChatGPT 插件——放在一起对比，讲清各自的边界；最后展望前沿：网关、MCP Apps（服务器渲染 UI）、Tasks（长任务）、扩展轨道这些 2026 年新增的方向。</p>\n<p><strong>与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>要分清楚。如果你想学 agent 怎么编排、怎么管记忆，去 <a href=\"../ai-agent-frameworks/\">AI Agent 框架</a>——那里的 <a href=\"../ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/function-calling\">函数调用</a>讲的是模型如何决定调哪个工具，而本 hub 讲的是工具如何被「标准化地暴露」。如果你关心模型怎么输出严格 JSON，去 <a href=\"../structured-output-constrained-decoding/\">结构化输出与受约束解码</a>——MCP 的工具 schema 只声明形状，真正逼模型产出合规 JSON 是那个 hub 的事。如果你关心提示注入与对抗攻击的通用防御，去 <a href=\"../ai-safety-alignment/robustness/prompt-injection\">AI 安全与对齐</a>；本 hub 只讲 MCP 协议层特有的安全面。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：读本 hub 你需要熟悉 HTTP 与 JSON、了解什么是 LLM 的工具调用（function calling）、会读一点 TypeScript 或 Python。不需要懂任何具体 agent 框架。<strong>推荐路径</strong>：协议实现者从第一章顺读到第三章；只想接入现成 server 的应用开发者，可先读 <a href=\"foundations/why-mcp\">为何需要 MCP</a> 与 <a href=\"practice/mcp-ecosystem\">生态与客户端</a>，再按需回看原语章。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-mcp","title":"为何需要 MCP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/foundations/why-mcp"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mcp-architecture","title":"架构 host/client/server","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/foundations/mcp-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"protocol-jsonrpc","title":"协议与 JSON-RPC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/foundations/protocol-jsonrpc"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"primitives","title":"原语","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/primitives","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tools-primitive","title":"工具原语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/primitives/tools-primitive"},{"seq":2,"slug":"resources-primitive","title":"资源原语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/primitives/resources-primitive"},{"seq":3,"slug":"prompts-sampling","title":"提示与采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/primitives/prompts-sampling"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"building","title":"构建","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/building","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"building-mcp-servers","title":"构建 MCP 服务器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/building/building-mcp-servers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"transports-lifecycle","title":"传输与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/building/transports-lifecycle"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mcp-security","title":"安全与权限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/building/mcp-security"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mcp-ecosystem","title":"生态与客户端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/practice/mcp-ecosystem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mcp-vs-alternatives","title":"与函数调用/插件对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/practice/mcp-vs-alternatives"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mcp-patterns-frontier","title":"模式与前沿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/practice/mcp-patterns-frontier"}]}]}